# monomind runtime — entirely local tool state (config, caches, DBs, and a
# live dashboard-token secret); the narrow per-subpath rules this replaced
# kept missing new files as the tool evolved, which is how dashboard-token
# ended up untracked-but-unignored.
.monomind/

